      },
      "source": [
        "html_content = \"\"\"\n",
        "<!DOCTYPE html>\n",
        "<html lang=\"en\">\n",
        "<head>\n",
        "    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n",
        "    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n",
        "    <title>Greeting Card for KAJABIR</title>\n",
        "    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n",
        "</head>\n",
        "<body>\n",
        "    <div class=\"card-container\">\n",
        "        <div class=\"card\">\n",
        "            <div class=\"header-image\">\n",
        "                <img src=\"/content/Buzz Lightyear is a toy based on a Space Ranger from Toy Box who is a party member in Kingdom Hearts II… _ Toy story characters, Woody toy story, Toy story birthday.jpg\" alt=\"Toy Story Header\" class=\"card-header-img\">\n",
        "            </div>\n",
        "            <div class=\"card-content\">\n",
        "                <h1>to KAJABIR</h1>\n",
        "                <p>Makasih banyak my Kajabir atau super duper jendril yang udah mau menerima aku sebagai dejabir, maaf banget kalo aku sebagai dejabir yang plenger emang soalnya bawaan dari kecil tetapi walupun begitu aku tetep bakal jadi dejabir yang baik kepada kajabirnya nanti kalau super duper jendril lagi susah aku siap membantu kapan pun itu dan juga untuk komitmen komitmen yang aku siapkan semoga bisa terlaksana dan membanggakan semoga ini berkesan love kajabir</p>\n",
        "            </div>\n",
        "            <div class=\"footer-image\">\n",
        "                <img src=\"/content/download.jpg\" alt=\"Toy Story Footer\" class=\"card-footer-img\">\n",
        "            </div>\n",
        "        </div>\n",
        "    </div>\n",
        "</body>\n",
        "</html>\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "with open('greeting_card.html', 'w') as f:\n",
        "    f.write(html_content)\n",
        "print(\"Generated greeting_card.html\")"
      ],
